# GoOnlinePOS AI Marketing Agent - environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (never commit the real `.env`) and fill in real
# values ONLY once you reach the phase that needs them. Nothing in Phase 1
# (analyze-product / refresh-features) reads any of these - the whole
# feature-verification step is local file reading only, zero network calls,
# zero API keys required.
#
# Safety rules this file exists to satisfy:
#   6. Never expose API keys or OAuth credentials in source code.
#   7. Use environment variables for secrets.

# --- Phase 5: optional future paid AI video-generation API -----------------
# Leave blank for the free local pipeline (Pillow + a locally installed,
# free/open-source ffmpeg binary). Only needed if/when you choose to wire up
# FutureAIVideoGenerator in agent/video/generator.py.
# AI_VIDEO_API_KEY=

# --- Phase 6: YouTube (YouTube Data API v3) ---------------------------------
# Required only once YouTubePublisher moves out of dry-run mode.
# YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=
# YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# YOUTUBE_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# --- Phase 6: Facebook / Meta Graph API -------------------------------------
# Required only once FacebookPublisher moves out of dry-run mode.
# FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID=
# FACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
